{"title":"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c93a7f66d24d73b62b9b6365f36600925d02feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d69d60c81fdde64d33430075dfe3e87a6a34859f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca35666be527954e9abcec2e84408f1ae3cdf1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{(a-b)^{2015}+1^{2015}}{(a-b)^{2015}-1^{2015}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"146\" height=\"45\" /> .\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/0/6809736e570c0e4aaab711aae84b45a520cec1b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a2258617f220a5b1db96d463616064254f9825a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3^{2} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db7ef6d16604ff1ea2b8b732daccc8b8a04e0fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b = 8 - 9 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"154\" height=\"16\" />. Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e91502a903a36a53e20e46868126789b301dde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> into the expression, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844a52b3d6d0f85537231ede8de1acac4df000aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(-1)^{2015} + 1^{2015}}{(-1)^{2015} - 1^{2015}} = \\frac{-1 + 1}{-1 - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"212\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/a/08ae71187981f9d1de31eb8718c4a52ec8bed4b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{0}{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abdb407f58a63c2e882b288f4783c4ad830e5af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC\">2015 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\